      "writtenOn": "2021-10-18T22:57:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Patchset 9 \u003d\u003d Patchset 7, only difference is that patchset 9 is more up to date with cros/main",
      "revId": "389823858ecd51054c30b122140f2192f9cb13d3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3356c6b2_cc3247f4",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-20T04:34:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Mainly stylistic nits. It\u0027s a bit awkward to have a define for this specific variation of a sub command. If you try redefining the CONFIG_CONSOLE_HISTORY for these boards to 4 or less, do they build?\n\n\u0026\u0026 if so, I\u0027d split the board specific changes out to separate commits and have them as parents of the common change. You can use a circular CQ-DEPEND to make sure that they go in as a group.",
      "revId": "389823858ecd51054c30b122140f2192f9cb13d3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cf92b166_686e40d5",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1523223
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-20T22:49:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree I\u0027d rather have a solution that avoids introducing a new flag.\n\nGood news is that volteer, kukui, and terrador still work when CONFIG_SIMPLE_OUTPUT is removed, I assume some upstream change saved extra memory for these boards. \n\nBad news is redefining CONFIG_CONSOLE_HISTORY for the other boards, burnet and kodama, only worked when the value was lowered to 1. Worse, servo_v4 already had the value undef\u0027ed in it\u0027s header file. \n\nOne line of console history doesn\u0027t seem very useful, are there other flags that could be changed instead?",
      "parentUuid": "3356c6b2_cc3247f4",
      "revId": "389823858ecd51054c30b122140f2192f9cb13d3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9904fbcf_2d06643f",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1479762
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-20T22:51:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry for the delayed review.\n\nThis change introduces a new config option: CONFIG_SIMPLE_OUTPUT. \n1. The name \"simple output\" is very broad, I would suggest CONFIG_CMD_SRCCAPS_SIMPLE_OUTPUT or CONFIG_CMD_SRCCAPS_REDUCED_SIZE\n2. Please add the default with a brief comment to ec/include/config.h  \n",
      "revId": "389823858ecd51054c30b122140f2192f9cb13d3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d29046cc_67298053",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1523223
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-20T23:13:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hopefully I can leave out the flag entirely, but I agree I\u0027ll make the name more specific, and add it to include/config.h",
      "parentUuid": "9904fbcf_2d06643f",
      "revId": "389823858ecd51054c30b122140f2192f9cb13d3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
