        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-20T23:23:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, if you\u0027re down to 1 history entry, I would just undefine it entirely. It\u0027s not the end of the world.\n\nCheckout this link for some suggestions: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/main/docs/reducing_ec_image_size.md#disable-console-commands",
      "parentUuid": "cf92b166_686e40d5",
      "revId": "389823858ecd51054c30b122140f2192f9cb13d3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
