      "writtenOn": "2021-10-21T20:55:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the link! It\u0027ll be a good resource going forward. I solved the issue by defaulting to the old way of printing `srccaps` for boards like servo_v4.\n\nGoing back to what you said earlier, is there a resource I could read to go ahead and restructure the commits? So that the board specific changes are standalone but dependent? I\u0027m not sure if I\u0027d go about changing things on gerrit or locally.",
      "parentUuid": "c7961fda_a8792fb2",
      "revId": "389823858ecd51054c30b122140f2192f9cb13d3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
