      "writtenOn": "2021-10-21T21:54:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The closest one that I can think of is this: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/docs/+/HEAD/firmware_code_reviews.md\n\nI think for this if you split of the board changes into separate CLs, have this CL Cq-Depend on the one on the top of your stack. And have that one Cq-Depend on this CL.",
      "parentUuid": "011abb57_507d677b",
      "revId": "389823858ecd51054c30b122140f2192f9cb13d3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
